# The fixed part of the package description: `make package-args` writes
# release/package.args from it and src/settings.def (a --setting line per row);
# `make test` fails when that file is out of date.
#
# Bridge 1.0 only (README, "Status"): the menu label and bring-to-front. The
# daemon still places its own window and the manager cannot yet hold iDrive's
# focus for it or step it aside for the camera: not for use while driving.
--app
android-auto
--compat
nbt_6.5_armv7
--bridge
1.0
--bridge-uses=
--bridge-optional
show,status
